WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.584 --> 00:00:03.584
(suspenseful music)

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.612
(door handle jiggling)

00:00:22.612 --> 00:00:26.112
(feet stomping up stairs)

00:00:29.106 --> 00:00:32.353
(glass shattering)

00:00:32.353 --> 00:00:35.786
(dramatic music)

00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:37.536
- I know you're here.

00:00:41.391 --> 00:00:45.141
If you come out I promise
I'll make it quick.

00:00:47.189 --> 00:00:49.189
Oh, feelin' shy, are we?

00:00:52.022 --> 00:00:55.593
If you come out I'll let you play with

00:00:55.593 --> 00:00:56.778
this puppy.

00:00:56.778 --> 00:00:59.142
(dramatic music)

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:02.059
Oh look how cute and fluffy she is.

00:01:05.162 --> 00:01:07.277
Oh no, she's cold.

00:01:07.277 --> 00:01:10.822
I guess I'll have to put
this little sweater on her.

00:01:10.822 --> 00:01:13.643
(squeaking)

00:01:13.643 --> 00:01:16.654
And of course, the ensemble
wouldn't be complete

00:01:16.654 --> 00:01:20.162
without a tiny little police hat.

00:01:20.162 --> 00:01:22.661
(squeaking)

00:01:22.661 --> 00:01:26.062
Oh, who's a tiny little police officer?

00:01:26.062 --> 00:01:28.895
You are, yes you are, yes you are.

00:01:31.081 --> 00:01:35.248
Oh looks like our little
copper could use a friend.

00:01:37.165 --> 00:01:38.861
(laughing)

00:01:38.861 --> 00:01:40.707
- Oh, you're so cute.

00:01:40.707 --> 00:01:42.894
(intense music)

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:44.377
Oh fuck.

00:01:44.377 --> 00:01:47.127
(dramatic music)

00:01:49.739 --> 00:01:50.572
Worth it.

